1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
A walkthrough of the published configuration using real n8n screens. Waiting time is compressed.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Start n8n and Ollama. Confirm gemma4:12b and your SerpApi credentials are configured.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:18,000
At localhost:5678, open Research Orchestrator. Click Execute workflow, then open its company form.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Enter the real company name, official website, sector and geography. Attach its annual report when available.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Enter yes in Refresh Leadership to run Agent 4 live. Leave it blank to reuse profiles saved within seven days.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Agent 1 selects peers; Agents 2 and 3 research signals. Agent 4 researches leaders; the orchestrator compiles the deck.

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Run 196 reached Download Briefing and saved memory. It selected 1 of five requested peers; read the gaps.

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Open Download Briefing, choose Binary, then download presentation. Open the editable PPTX in PowerPoint.

9
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Open Research Memory - Recall. Enter the company and optionally a run ID, then download saved research.

10
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:00,000
The GitHub presentations folder contains both PowerPoints, PDFs, this video and its caption file.
